flowchart LR
  subgraph P1[Phase 1: Work Pack Preparation]
    A([Start]) --> B[Retrieve scheduled work orders\nfrom AMOS]
    B --> C[Load MEL/CDL deferred\ndefect carry-forwards]
    C --> D{Work pack complete and\nresources confirmed?}
    D -- No --> E[Requisition parts/tools\nfrom AMOS stores]
    E --> D
    D -- Yes --> F[Approved work pack\nand crew assignment]
  end
  subgraph P2[Phase 2: Aircraft Arrival and Log Review]
    F --> G[Receive Electronic Technical\nLog from flight crew]
    G --> H[Categorise open defects\nby MEL interval]
    H --> I{Category A defect\nrequiring AOG action?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Raise AOG alert and\nescalate to MCC]
    J --> K[Initiate AOG rectification\nwork order in AMOS]
    I -- No --> L[Defect list accepted\nfor standard process]
  end
  subgraph P3[Phase 3: Turnaround Check Execution]
    L --> M[Perform exterior walkaround\nper AMM 05-10]
    K --> M
    M --> N[Service fluids — fuel, oil,\nhydraulic, LOX via AMOS]
    N --> O[Avionics and safety equipment\nfunctional checks]
    O --> P{All check items signed off\nwithin turnaround window?}
    P -- No --> Q[Request ground time extension\nvia Amadeus AMS]
    Q --> O
    P -- Yes --> R[Check completion record\nlogged in AMOS]
  end
  subgraph P4[Phase 4: Defect Rectification]
    R --> S[Diagnose defect per\nAMM/TSM procedures]
    S --> T{Part available\nin station stock?}
    T -- No --> U[Apply MEL deferral and\nlog in CAMP Airworthiness]
    T -- Yes --> V[Replace/repair component;\nrecord in AMOS work order]
    U --> W{Rectification complete\nbefore departure?}
    V --> W
    W -- No --> X[Coordinate AOG part\nshipment via AMOS AOG desk]
    X --> V
    W -- Yes --> Y[Rectification signed off\nby supervising engineer]
  end
  subgraph P5[Phase 5: Airworthiness Release]
    Y --> Z[Perform final inspection and\nduplicate check if required]
    Z --> AA{Duplicate inspection\nrequired by regulation?}
    AA -- Yes --> AB[Second LAME performs\nindependent inspection]
    AB --> AC
    AA -- No --> AC[Issue Certificate of Release\nto Service in AMOS]
    AC --> AD[Update Electronic Technical\nLog — close open items]
  end
  subgraph P6[Phase 6: Data Close-Out]
    AD --> AE[Close all work orders\nand task cards in AMOS]
    AE --> AF[Log component removals/installs\nin CAMP airworthiness tracking]
    AF --> AG[Transmit maintenance data\nto AWS Redshift data lake]
    AG --> AH([End])
  end

  style A fill:#003366,color:#fff,stroke:#003366
  style AH fill:#003366,color:#fff,stroke:#003366
  style D fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
  style I fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
  style P fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
  style T fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
  style W fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
  style AA fill:#ff6600,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6600
